{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02701",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.18,
      "end_seconds": 6.06,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "Um, sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.76,
      "end_seconds": 10.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.12,
      "end_seconds": 21.4,
      "duration_seconds": 10.28,
      "text": "Yeah, it's aching all over. I don't know what's causing it. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 25.25,
      "end_seconds": 35.55,
      "duration_seconds": 10.3,
      "text": "Okay, so the vitals from earlier. Oxygen saturation is 99 percent, blood pressure 114 over 79, pulse is 73 beats a minute, temperature is 36.8 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.14,
      "end_seconds": 42.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Thanks. Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.65,
      "end_seconds": 48.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "So, for six months, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.13,
      "end_seconds": 52.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.85,
      "end_seconds": 55.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "I'd say moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.88,
      "end_seconds": 61.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Is it there all the time or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.5,
      "end_seconds": 65.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "Honestly, a few times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.79,
      "end_seconds": 69.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Okay, is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.77,
      "end_seconds": 74.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "It, It usually comes with tender spots."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.24,
      "end_seconds": 81.42,
      "duration_seconds": 6.18,
      "text": "I was just going to say that the main thing is—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 81.52,
      "end_seconds": 89.01,
      "duration_seconds": 7.49,
      "text": "Sorry to cut in, doctor, quick question: shall I bring the trolley in now or later?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.56,
      "end_seconds": 91.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Later, thanks. Please go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.21,
      "end_seconds": 109.0,
      "duration_seconds": 12.79,
      "text": "As for tender spots, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.02,
      "end_seconds": 114.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.29,
      "end_seconds": 118.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "It's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.24,
      "end_seconds": 124.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "Have you had aching all over before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.64,
      "end_seconds": 135.15,
      "duration_seconds": 7.51,
      "text": "Well, I had a similar thing about six months ago. It went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 136.35,
      "end_seconds": 138.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Mm, that's what happened, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.53,
      "end_seconds": 143.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "A few quick ones: joint swelling or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.95,
      "end_seconds": 158.95,
      "duration_seconds": 14.0,
      "text": "Uh, you know, no, no joint swelling, no weight loss. I did have poor concentration at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.63,
      "end_seconds": 163.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any rash or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.61,
      "end_seconds": 168.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Oh, no, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.58,
      "end_seconds": 174.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.52,
      "end_seconds": 179.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Um, uh, no, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.23,
      "end_seconds": 182.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Okay, do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.31,
      "end_seconds": 187.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.92,
      "end_seconds": 190.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Alright, is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.14,
      "end_seconds": 195.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.24,
      "end_seconds": 198.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 200.8,
      "end_seconds": 206.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "I mean, I had a bunion operation six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.77,
      "end_seconds": 210.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.33,
      "end_seconds": 222.5,
      "duration_seconds": 9.17,
      "text": "Yes, depression. I have anxiety, for about a year. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.54,
      "end_seconds": 234.44,
      "duration_seconds": 9.9,
      "text": "Understood. Okay, I can see anxiety in your file as well. Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.68,
      "end_seconds": 239.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, uh, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.08,
      "end_seconds": 244.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.28,
      "end_seconds": 249.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "My son has asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.78,
      "end_seconds": 266.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.17,
      "end_seconds": 271.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Escitalopram, 10 milligrams, maybe, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.11,
      "end_seconds": 277.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Did you happen to bring the box or the paperwork?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.74,
      "end_seconds": 280.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "No, it's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.1,
      "end_seconds": 286.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.06,
      "end_seconds": 289.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.32,
      "end_seconds": 292.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.01,
      "end_seconds": 307.28,
      "duration_seconds": 6.27,
      "text": "Your joints are not swollen and you are tender over many muscle points."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.82,
      "end_seconds": 312.52,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.6,
      "end_seconds": 325.95,
      "duration_seconds": 8.35,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again. Putting it all together, the most likely explanation is fibromyalgia. Polymyalgia is still possible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.04,
      "end_seconds": 348.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "I think blood tests makes sense here, for widespread pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 349.5,
      "end_seconds": 353.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "I can book that for Wednesday at 11:30 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 355.16,
      "end_seconds": 382.15,
      "duration_seconds": 26.99,
      "text": "You'll be taking amitriptyline, 10 milligrams, at night, long term. You take it by mouth. That's for pain and sleep. Gentle graded exercise such as swimming helps more than rest. We'll refer you to the pain clinic. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 383.2,
      "end_seconds": 386.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}